      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When a user submits a \"Right to be Forgotten\" request under GDPR, the company must promptly inform the individual of the request within one week and acknowledge receipt. Within 33 days, they must assess the request, and if the data is to be erased, they must erase it, unless the information is necessary for statute law enforcement, tax law obligations, or other exceptional circumstances. The company should also verify the erasure and inform the individual, in writing, once completion has been confirmed.",
