      "content": "thanks for clarifying that. what if we find that some data is just really hard to locate in the archives? like, if there's stuff tucked away in obscure logs or old storage layers that isn't easy to scan. does the 'good-faith' part cover us if we aren't 100% sure we found every single trace?",
